    "question": "A casino table pays 3:2 if you get a blackjack with your first 2 cards. If you scored a blackjack and were paid $60, what was your original bet?",
    "gold": "40",
    "answer": "The payout for blackjack is 3:2 or 3/2=1.5 times my bet\nIf my original bet was X then I won 1.5*X my bet\nGiven that I was paid $60 we know $60 = 1.5X\nX=$60/1.5\nX=$<<40=40>>40 was my original bet\n#### 40"
